    67	In this study, we used sMRI data from 1,113 healthy controls taken from the ' 1200 Subjects Data Release (S1200 Release, March 2017) ' which is part of the HCP data set (see http://www.humanconnectome.org/ documentation/S1200/ for technical information). We also analyzed
